er-bottom: 1px solid #cfd4da; font-size: 16px;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.prd-table {\r\n\t\t\t\twidth: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; font-size: 14px;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.prd-table th,\r\n\t\t\t.prd-table td {\r\n\t\t\t\tborder-right: 1px solid #cfd4da; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfd4da; padding: 12px 10px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.6;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.prd-table th {\r\n\t\t\t\twidth: 14%; background: #fafafa; font-weight: 600;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.prd-table td:last-child,\r\n\t\t\t.prd-table th:last-child {\r\n\t\t\t\tborder-right: 0;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.prd-table tr:last-child td,\r\n\t\t\t.prd-table tr:last-child th {\r\n\t\t\t\tborder-bottom: 0;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.prd-note {\r\n\t\t\t\tfont-size: 13px; color: #666; margin: 8px 0 24px; line-height: 1.6;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.abs-sec h3 {\r\n\t\t\t\tfont-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 16px;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.abs-box {\r\n\t\t\t\tborder: 1px solid #cfd4da; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.abs-table {\r\n\t\t\t\twidth: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; font-size: 14px;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.abs-table th,\r\n\t\t\t.abs-table td {\r\n\t\t\t\tborder-right: 1px solid #cfd4da; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfd4da; padding: 12px 10px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.abs-table thead th {\r\n\t\t\t\tbackground: #f5f6f7; font-weight: 700;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.abs-table td:first-child {\r\n\t\t\t\tbackground: #fafafa; font-weight: 600;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.abs-table tr:last-child td {\r\n\t\t\t\tborder-bottom: 0;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t.abs-table th:last-child,\r\n\t\t\t.abs-table td:last-child {\r\n\t\t\t\tborder-right: 0;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t@media (max-width:768px) {\r\n\t\t\t\t.prd-sec {\r\n\t\t\t\t\tpadding: 0 14px;\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\t.prd-table,\r\n\t\t\t\t.abs-table {\r\n\t\t\t\t\tfont-size: 13px;\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t</style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"cafe-wrap\">\r\n\r\n<h2>단타공흡음패널</h2>\r\n<div class=\"en-title\">Micro Holes Acoustic Panels</div>\r\n<hr class=\"cafe-hr\" />\r\n\r\n<h3>상품 사양</h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"basic-table\"><tbody><tr><th>제조</th>\r\n<td>원산지 (대한민국)<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;display: inline !important;float: none\"></span></td></tr>\r\n<tr><th>타공규격</th>\r\n<td>5Ø\r\n<br />\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><th>두께</th>\r\n<td>16pitch</td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h3>상품 설명</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n음향타공판은 저음력에서 흡음력이 우수하며 배후공기층에 다공질 재료를 충진하면 흡음력이 고주파 쪽으로 이동합니다. 음의 반사와 흡음을 적절히 가지고 있어 실내에서 보다 좋은 소리를 가질 수 있습니다. 마감은 친환경 피니싱호일을 기본으로, LPM, 필름 및 도장, 무늬목 등 다양한 마감이 가능합니다.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>적용 부위</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n회의실, 강의실, 체육관, 사무실, 학교, 상업공간 등 흡음이 필요한 공간</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"graph-sec\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"graph-sec\">\r\n\r\n<h3>흡음 성능 그래프</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"graph-box\">\r\n<div class=\"graph-inner\">\r\n<img alt=\"흡음률(Absorption) 그래프\" class=\"graph-img\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/goods/hole_n03.jpg\" />\r\n\r\n<div class=\"graph-note\">\r\n※ 본 그래프는 주파수(Hz)에 따른 흡음률(Absorption) 특성을 나타낸 자료입니다. 시험 조건 및 시공 환경에 따라 실제 수치는 다소 차이가 발생할 수 있습니다.\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"prd-sec\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"prd-box\">\r\n<div class=\"prd-head\">제품규격</div>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"prd-table\"><tbody><tr><th>크기</th>\r\n<td>1200 × 2400</td>\r\n<th>두께</th>\r\n<td>9T (12T, 15T)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><th>마감</th>\r\n<td>필름, LPM, 도장 외</td>\r\n<th>재질</th>\r\n<td>MDF(530kg/㎥ 이상)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><th>타공 규격</th>\r\n<td>3Ø (4Ø, 5Ø, 6Ø)</td>\r\n<th>타공 간격</th>\r\n<td>16pitch, 32pitch</td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"prd-note\">※ 표시된 규격은 일반적인 규격이며, 주문규격으로 생산이 가능합니다.</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"abs-sec\">\r\n\r\n<h3>주파수별 흡음률</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"abs-box\">\r\n\r\n<table class=\"abs-table\"><thead>\r\n<tr><th>주파수(Hz)</th>\r\n<th>125</th>\r\n<th>250</th>\r\n<th>500</th>\r\n<th>1000</th>\r\n<th>2000</th>\r\n<th>4000</th>\r\n<th>NRC</th></tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>흡음률</td>\r\n<td>0.61</td>\r\n<td>0.78</td>\r\n<td>0.55</td>\r\n<td>0.48</td>\r\n<td>0.37</td>\r\n<td>0.27</td>\r\n<td>0.55</td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div></div></div></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}